# Project OSMO Dashboard — Structure

Target folder structure for the Next.js dashboard. Mirror the legacy client (`client/`) layout where applicable; adapt for App Router and TypeScript.

## Root Layout

```
dashboard/
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/                 # Cursor rule files (.mdc)
│       ├── core-development.mdc
│       ├── cursor-rules.mdc
│       ├── nextjs.mdc
│       ├── creation-rules.mdc
│       └── structure.mdc
├── public/                    # Static assets (favicon, images)
├── src/
│   ├── app/                   # App Router
│   │   ├── layout.tsx         # Root layout (html, body, providers)
│   │   ├── page.tsx           # "/"
│   │   ├── globals.css        # Tailwind + CSS variables
│   │   ├── (auth)/            # Route group: auth pages
│   │   │   ├── login/
│   │   │   ├── signup/
│   │   │   └── forgot/
│   │   ├── (dashboard)/       # Route group: app shell
│   │   │   ├── layout.tsx     # AppLayout (Sidebar, TopBar)
│   │   │   ├── dashboard/
│   │   │   ├── notifications/
│   │   │   ├── social/        # social/calendar, social/analytics, etc.
│   │   │   ├── seo/
│   │   │   ├── ads/
│   │   │   ├── outreach/
│   │   │   ├── admin/
│   │   │   └── settings/
│   │   └── api/               # Optional API routes
│   │
│   ├── components/
│   │   ├── ui/                # Shadcn primitives (button, input, card, etc.)
│   │   ├── shared/            # Custom shared components
│   │   ├── layout/            # AppLayout, Sidebar, TopBar, SidebarItem
│   │   └── osmo/              # PageHeader, StatCard, DataTable, etc.
│   │
│   ├── constants/             # App-wide constants
│   │   └── *.constants.ts     # sidebar.constants.ts, etc.
│   │
│   ├── lib/                   # Utilities and shared logic
│   │   ├── utils.ts           # cn(), etc.
│   │   └── api/               # HTTP client, interceptors, *.api.ts
│   │
│   ├── hooks/                 # Custom hooks (auth, data, UI)
│   │   └── */                 # Organize by domain (auth/, seo/, etc.)
│   │
│   ├── context/               # React Context definitions (client)
│   │   └── *Context.tsx
│   │
│   ├── providers/             # Client-side providers (optional)
│   │   └── *Provider.tsx
│   │
│   └── middleware.ts          # Auth redirects, etc.
│
├── package.json
├── tsconfig.json
├── next.config.ts
├── tailwind.config.ts
├── postcss.config.mjs
├── shadcn.json
└── .env.local
```

## Mapping from Legacy Client

| Client (Vite/React)     | Dashboard (Next.js)           |
|------------------------|-------------------------------|
| `src/main.jsx`         | `src/app/layout.tsx` (root)   |
| `src/App.jsx`          | `src/app/layout.tsx` + routes |
| `src/ui/pages/*`       | `src/app/**/page.tsx`         |
| `src/ui/components/ui/`| `src/components/ui/`         |
| `src/ui/containers/layout/` | `src/components/layout/` |
| `src/ui/containers/osmo/`   | `src/components/osmo/`   |
| `src/services/api/`    | `src/lib/api/`                |
| `src/services/hooks/`  | `src/hooks/`                  |
| `src/services/context/`| `src/context/`                 |
| `src/services/providers/`   | `src/providers/` or layout |
| `src/constants/`       | `src/constants/`              |
| `src/lib/utils.js`     | `src/lib/utils.ts`           |
| `src/ui/guards/`       | `middleware.ts` + layout auth |

## Route Categories (Same as Legacy)

| Prefix        | Purpose        | Guard   | Example           |
|---------------|----------------|---------|-------------------|
| `/`           | Landing/redirect | Optional | → `/dashboard`   |
| `/auth/*`     | Authentication  | Guest   | `/auth/login`     |
| `/onboarding` | Onboarding      | Auth (no onboarding required) | |
| `/dashboard`  | Main app        | Auth    | `/dashboard`      |
| `/social/*`   | Social tools   | Auth    | `/social/calendar`|
| `/seo/*`      | SEO tools      | Auth    | `/seo/keywords`   |
| `/ads/*`      | Advertising    | Auth    | `/ads/dashboard`  |
| `/outreach/*` | Outreach       | Auth    | `/outreach/leads` |
| `/admin/*`    | Admin          | Auth    | `/admin/users`    |
| `/settings/*` | Settings       | Auth    | `/settings/account`|

## File Naming

- **Components**: PascalCase.tsx (e.g. `PageHeader.tsx`)
- **Hooks**: useCamelCase.ts (e.g. `useAuth.ts`)
- **API modules**: camelCase.ts under `lib/api/` (e.g. `auth.api.ts`)
- **Constants**: camelCase.constants.ts (e.g. `sidebar.constants.ts`)
- **Pages**: page.tsx, layout.tsx, loading.tsx, error.tsx

## Cursor Rules in This Project

- **core-development.mdc**: Execution sequence, coding standards, prohibited actions, UI rules.
- **cursor-rules.mdc**: Where and how to add new Cursor rules.
- **nextjs.mdc**: App Router, Server/Client components, routing, data fetching.
- **creation-rules.mdc**: How to create pages, components, API usage, auth.
- **structure.mdc**: This file — folder structure and legacy mapping.

Reference the repo root `docs/structure.mdx` for full route table and click flows of the legacy client when migrating or aligning behavior.
